    "chunk_text": "WHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour which accompanies this order exists between,\n\nMr. D.P.N.H. Mohotti, No. 32/2B, 7th Lane, Crow Island, Colombo 15.\n\nand\n\nVocational Training Authority of Sri Lanka, 354/2, 4th Floor, Nipunatha Piyasa, Elvitigala Mawatha, Narahenpita, Colombo 05.\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,31st July, 2025.\n\n4AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3: (I): (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.05\u2013 2025.08.05\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I)P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025 \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2022/124.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nMr. D.P.N.H. Mohotti, No.32/2B, 7th Lane, Crow Island, Colombo 05.\n\nand\n\nVocational Training Authority of Sri lanka, 354/2, 4th Floor, Nipunatha Piyasa, Elvitigala Mawatha, Narahenpita, Colombo 05.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether D.P.N.H. Mohotti working at the Vocational Training Authority of Sri Lanka in a Chief Management Assistant post has been caused injustice by the way in which the disciplinary inquiry against her was conducted and the disciplinary order dated 30.01.2020 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 21st day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08- 0061/2\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
  },
