    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.07PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2448/40 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 07 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.07No. 2448/40 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 07, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of land with below names and extents, depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. KU/WRY/2021/692 dated 26.07.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Siyambalakele (F.V.P. 2611) in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 1250 of Kithulwehera in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wariyapola in the District of Kurunegala, North Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Ela Langa Kumbura \u2013 Extent:0.0999 Hectare North: Ela Langa Idama and Oya Langa Kumbura claimed by N. W. L. S. Yasapalitha; East:\n\nOya Langa Kumbura and Moragaha Ela claimed by N. W. L. S. Yasapalitha; South: Moragaha Ela and Pradeshiya Sabha Road; West: Pradeshiya Sabha Road and Ela Langa Idama claimed by N. W. L. S. Yasapalitha.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Ela Langa Kumbura \u2013 Extent:0.1756 Hectare North: Ela Langa Kumbura claimed by D. A. M. Dissanayake and R. M. Piyadasa and Pradeshiya Sabha Road; East: Pradeshiya Sabha Road and Moragaha Ela; South: Moragaha Ela; West: Moragaha Ela and Ela Langa Kumbura claimed by D. A. M. Dissanayake."
